00:09:21.231 --> 00:09:25.630
I try to imply what I learned
in 7th grade even to this day.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.630
- Challenge.

00:09:27.549 --> 00:09:29.141
Other rappers.

00:09:29.141 --> 00:09:33.308
Have you been hearing things
coming out of other rappers

00:09:34.523 --> 00:09:38.733
that are going back at
you, or is it dying down?

00:09:38.733 --> 00:09:40.369
Or do they just take it as a challenge?

00:09:40.369 --> 00:09:41.914
- Yeah, I think they just
take it as a challenge.

00:09:41.914 --> 00:09:43.221
But you know, the whole point of the thing

00:09:43.221 --> 00:09:45.333
is not just to challenge for the moment.

00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:49.992
Challlenge for the whole
extension of this hip-hop culture,

00:09:49.992 --> 00:09:52.992
not just off the hype, but
what we going to do after,

00:09:52.992 --> 00:09:54.297
what we going to do to challenge ourself,

00:09:54.297 --> 00:09:56.825
how we going to make better records,
how we going to push forward

00:09:56.825 --> 00:09:59.213
and innovate the next generation coming up

00:09:59.213 --> 00:10:01.881
rather than just sticking
in the moment of a verse.

00:10:01.881 --> 00:10:03.751
So that was the whole point of the joint

00:10:03.751 --> 00:10:07.918
and I hope everybody really
get the ideal behind it.

